A link title crosses a soft wrap and an attribute value does not

```
[a](/u "t
u")
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t
u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a](/u 't
u')
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t
u">a</a></p>
```

```
![a](/i "t
u")
.
<img src="/i" alt="a" title="t
u">
```

```
[a](/u "t\"
u")
.
<p><a href="/u" title="t&quot;
u">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]{k="t
u"}
.
<p>[a]{k=“t
u”}</p>
```

```
[a][r]

[r]: /u "t
u"
.
<p>[a][r]</p>
<p>[r]: /u “t
u”</p>
```
